/// (`smithy_query(query="shape",shape="SubnetCidrBlockStateCode,VpcCidrBlockStateCode")`)
/// — what `DisassociateSubnetCidrBlock` answers, and a state in which the block is no
/// longer held ([`cidr_association_holds_its_block`]).
